# Ojer Pakpatiq, Deepest Epoch: "Whenever you cast an instant spell from your hand, it gains rebound." Only spells cast trigger it
# (CR 601.2i); a copy is created on the stack, not cast (CR 707.10), so it gets nothing. Bot1 casts Lightning Bolt at Bot2 (it gains
# rebound), then Fork targeting the Bolt (Fork gains rebound too). Fork resolves and is exiled (CR 702.88a); its copy of the Bolt deals
# 3 and ceases to exist (CR 704.5e); the original Bolt deals 3 and is exiled. Bot2 is at 14 with two cards in exile, none in Bot1's
# graveyard but the Lotus.

